Pointer as function parameter
void  ft_putchar(char c)
{
  write(1, &c, 1);
}

ft_putchar('K');

function parameter -> char c
argument -> 'K'

when we use the function, pass the value of 'K' to parameter c
so inside the function:
c = 'K'

